            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a 35 year old man, who first presented diffuse muscle pain and then joint pain, especially in the lumbar and right knee level. The diagnosis of gonococcal septicemia is done through positive blood cultures in the absence of genital signs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
